1
00:00:00,610 --> 00:00:03,080
(Penny:)And even if Raj wanted
something, he couldn't tell me.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,320
(Penny:)Howard won't order anything,

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,490
(Penny:)but he will come up
with some sort of skeevy comment

4
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:08,120
(Penny:)involving the words pie
or cheesecake.

5
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:10,320
(Penny:)And Leonard's
lactose intolerant,

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,720
(Penny:)so he can't eat anything here

7
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:13,260
(Penny:)without his intestines
blowing up

8
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:14,490
(Penny:)like a balloon animal.

9
00:00:14,490 --> 00:00:17,260
(Leonard:)Hang on a second.

10
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,830
(Leonard:)I could have the fruit platter.

11
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:19,800
(Penny:)You want the fruit platter?

12
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,330
(Leonard:)Does it have melon
on it?
Yeah.

13
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:22,800
(Leonard:)No, I can't eat melon.

14
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:25,340
(Penny:)Oh, Howard,
heads up.

15
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:28,510
(Penny:)Your ex-girlfriend just
came in for her shift.

16
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:30,340
(Leonard:)When was the last time
you saw her?

17
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,940
(Howard:)Oh, not since we broke up.

18
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:35,080
(Howard:)Wow. How am I going
to play this?

19
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,150
(Howard:)Sophisticated and relaxed?

20
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:38,550
(Howard:)Friendly, noncommittal?

21
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:40,350
(Howard:)Cold and distant?

22
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,060
(Bernadette:)Hi, guys.
Hey.

23
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:46,830
(Sheldon:)Hello.

24
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:51,030
(Sheldon:)I see you decided to go
with pathetic and frightened.

25
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:53,630
(Raj:)It's one of his best moves.

26
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:57,270
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

